  "details": "-ImmersiveHud\nImmersive Hud for VRChat, only displays the hud when notifications come in or a state changes (Mic mute/unmute, Gesture lock).\nHope that you can configure the duration that the hud stays visible, and also be able to disable Immersive Hud.\n-No Outlines\nThe cyan outlines around pickupable objects overrender everything in the game, causing disorientation and lessened immersion.\nHope there is a options to toggle off the outline around pickupable objects and the dashed line pointing to them.",
